denote">  If you want to learn more about how to actually train a model, yo=
u should go read the <a href=3D"https://huggingface.co/spaces/HuggingFaceTB=
/smol-training-playbook" target=3D"_blank" rel=3D"noopener noreferrer">Smol=
 Training Guidebook!</a> </aside> </div></div>
