<h4 id=3D"how-tokenization-can-mess-up-your-evaluation"><a href=3D"https://=
openevals-evaluation-guidebook.hf.space/#how-tokenization-can-mess-up-your-=
evaluation">How tokenization can mess up your evaluation</a></h4>
<p><strong>Managing fine-tuned models, system prompts and chat templates</s=
trong></p>
<p>Pre-2022, models used to simply be pretrained: text in, text out, nothin=
g else. Then, we got instruction tuning and chat models in 2023, and in 202=
5 reasoning models. This means that we went from using raw text to using mo=
re and more formatting.</p>
