der=3D"0" width=3D"100%" height=3D"650"></iframe> </div> <figcaption class=
=3D"reference__caption" data-astro-cid-e5g6tzce=3D"">Very nice demo by Yenn=
ie Jun on tokenization issues across languages</figcaption> </figure> </div=
>  </div>
<p>If you are in this case, the number of tokens that the model is allowed =
to generate for an evaluation should also be language dependent, as not all=
 languages are tokenized in similar amount of tokens.</p>
