vity</div> </div> <div class=3D"note__content" data-astro-cid-qg6lmfty=3D""=
> <p>We did some experiments on this (you=E2=80=99ll see up to a 7 points d=
ifference for the same model on the semantically equivalent prompts, the 5 =
rightmost columns), and a A <a href=3D"https://arxiv.org/abs/2310.11324" ta=
rget=3D"_blank" rel=3D"noopener noreferrer">paper observed similar results<=
/a>.</p><p><strong>Other example</strong>: Llama 3.1 models predicted corre=
ct MATH-Hard answers but scored poorly on the Open LLM Leaderboard, because=
 they overfit to GSM8K=E2=80=99s prompt format and couldn=E2=80=99t adapt t=
o the new one for this eval, despite it being provided in few shot examples=
